    "scenesThatPass": [
      "NORA: A nun!? What are you talking about, a nun!? That's just fucking crazy Cathleen, where is this even coming from!?\nCATHLEEN: I knew you wouldn't understand! It's fine if you don't understand...\nNORA: It's not that I don't understand, it's just that it's the stupidest thing I've ever heard!! You're telling me you want to go throw your life…\nCATHLEEN: But it's not throwing my life away! It's not throwing my life away!",
      "MARY GRACE: really wants you here shines all around make a great nun.\nSISTER CATHLEEN: Thank you Sister. That means so much.\nSISTER MARY GRACE: Do me a favor though, just make sure it's what you want too. Because your wants matter too. Do you know what I mean by that?",
      "SISTER MARY GRACE: I wanted to let you all know that I've decided I'm going to be leaving the convent... I'm so sorry I won't be here to see you all take your …\nSISTER EMILY: What? But what do you mean? Where are you going?\nSISTER CHARLOTTE: It's because of Reverend Mother isn't it. She wants to take you away from us.\nSISTER MARY GRACE: No, it's not because of her. It's not because of anything... I'm just not sure this life is for me anymore? I've been a Rose since I was 16 …",
      "SISTER EVELYN: I LOVE YOU SO MUCH RIGHT NOW GOD!!\nSISTER EMILY: I'M MARRIED TO JESUS CHRIST!!",
      "SISTER EVELYN: No... I mean how would she even know what I did, if she hadn't broken Custody of the Eyes to look at me?\nSISTER CANDACE: I didn't!! You're vain!!\nSISTER EVELYN: You did! You're a liar! That's a fault too!"
    ]
  },
